# Pairs with ClaimHeadMeetsHandOffClose (E -> H). ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends no longer
# covers F, so F's close re-claims with a head at or below a foreign append it allocated.
MODULE: ClaimHeadMeetsHandOffCloseHeadUncovered
TARGET: ClaimHeadMeetsHandOffClose
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: E's claim head no longer covers F's prior appends

--- FIND
ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends ==
    \A a \in Claimants : cstage[a] = 3 => \A o \in prior[a] : o < claimHead[a]
--- REPLACE
ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends ==
    \A a \in Claimants \ {"F"} : cstage[a] = 3 => \A o \in prior[a] : o < claimHead[a]
--- END
